From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Georg Lehmann <dadschoorse@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 20:06:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] radv: disable nir_opt_reassociate_for_fma for VS if it's not
 the last pre FS shader

Invariant position doesn't cover generic VS outputs used
to compute position in later stages.

